{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-upstream-mathlib-additions","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:upstream-mathlib-additions","kind":"proposition","title":"Upstream Mathlib additions: complex dilogarithm via tsum + BW formula + $\\mathrm{Cl}_2$ oddness","cites":["references/zagier1986","references/bloch2000"],"tags":["mathlib-filler","complex-dilogarithm","bloch-wigner-dilogarithm","clausen-oddness","lean-construction","upstream-contribution"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.Archimedean.UpstreamAdditions.complexLiTwo","text":"upstream-mathlib-additions.md","leanSource":"upstream-mathlib-additions.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:upstream-mathlib-additions\"></a><p>The file <a href=\"upstream-mathlib-additions.lean\"><code>upstream-mathlib-additions.lean</code></a> provides three unconditional additions for Mathlib (see <a href=\"#tbl:upstream-mathlib-additions-table1-data\" data-at=\"appendix-formalisation-notes/lean-mathlib-upstreaming/lean-mathlib-dilog\">Table 1</a>): (A) a concrete <code>tsum</code>-based complex dilogarithm <code>complexLiTwo</code>, a candidate for <code>Real.dilog</code> / <code>Complex.dilog</code>; (B) <code>blochWigner</code>, built from <code>Complex.log</code> and <code>Complex.arg</code>; and (C) the Clausen reflection identity <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{Cl}_2(-\\theta) = -\\mathrm{Cl}_2(\\theta)</code>, an unconditional Lean theorem.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-formalisation-notes/upstream-mathlib-additions.md","heading":"Proposition","number":"29.2.4","page":"b/prop-upstream-mathlib-additions","qa":{"counts":{"pass":95,"fail":1,"warn":1,"na":18,"unknown":0,"stale":89},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expec